<title>GREECE: FUND MANAGERS BRIEFED ON OTE, K.I.SARANDOPOULOS.</title>
<headline>FUND MANAGERS BRIEFED ON OTE, K.I.SARANDOPOULOS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The programme of company presentations of Athens bourse listings resumed in the new year with fund managers briefed by state telecom OTE and construction firm K.I.Sarandopoulos executives.</p>
<p>OTE president Dimiris Papoulias, chief financial officer Christos Kazantzis and Costas Sarandopoulos updated institutional investors on their companies, the Union of Institutional Investors said in a statement. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
